  - m_Id: 16000000000112
    m_Localized: "This game contains flashing lights and rapid visual changes. These may trigger seizures or discomfort, even if you have never had a seizure.\n\nIf you feel dizzy or notice changes in vision, muscle twitching or disorientation, stop playing and consult a healthcare professional.\n\nIf you or a family member have a history of seizures, consult a healthcare professional before playing."
